<title>UK: Copamex Industrias prices $200 mln 7-year bond.</title>
<headline>Copamex Industrias prices $200 mln 7-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced</p>
<p>earlier has been priced by lead manager Citibank International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COPAMEX INDUSTRIAS SA DE CV</p>
<p> AMT   $200 MLN	 COUPON     11.375    MATURITY  **30.APR.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.901    PAY DATE  **30.APR.97</p>
<p> YTM	  11.396    REOFFER    =	   SPREAD     +450 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  MEXICO    SALE LIMITS US/UK/MX</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.875 PCT FEB.04 U.S TREASURY</p>
<p>NOTES	*CALLABLE 30.APR.02 AND 30.APR.03</p>
<p>	  **NEW MATURITY AND PAYDATE, WAS 06.MAY</p>
